    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i get that, but my doctor is super busy and it's gonna take them a week to even call me back. i'm just in so much pain right now and i've taken sertraline for so long i'm used to it. is it really that dangerous to just take one or two of those tramadol pills? i just need something to help me sleep tonight so i can deal with it tomorrow.",
